if {niece_introduced} == false:
	set {niece_introduced} = true
	join detective right
	detective: Hello.
	join niece left
	niece: Hello, madam. You’re the detective, I presume?
	detective: Yes. I’m here to find the Count’s murderer.
	detective: Can you tell me everything you remember about the events leading up to the murder?
	niece: Indubitably!
	niece: My dear uncle Dracula was hosting a dinner party for many guests, myself included of course!
	niece: We were all having a wonderful time, but unfortunately, after a while, only a few of us remained: Dracula, [FRIEND], and myself.
	niece (disappointed): We had not long since finished our desserts when my poor uncle suddenly collapsed!
	niece (speaking): [FRIEND] and I took him upstairs to his quarters so that he could rest in a safer place. 
	niece: We left the room, of course. A vampire needs his privacy.
	niece: Not too long after, the guard and I went to check on him…
	niece (disappointed): …and found a stake buried in his chest.
	detective: Can you tell me more about yourself?
	niece (speaking): Absolutely!
	niece: I am [NIECE], Count Dracula’s niece. He has many, but I'm no doubt his favorite.
	niece: I’ve been told that I’m a bit dramatic, but I prefer the term…
	niece: …theatrical!
else:
	join niece left
	niece: However may I assist you?
- Question
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"present_evidence":"niece"}"]
- Leave
